{"t":"OUST","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Ouster, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","employees":320,"hq":"San Francisco, CA, United States","website":"https://ouster.com","summary_en":"Ouster, Inc. engages in the production and sale of lidar sensor kits for the automotive, industrial, robotics, and smart infrastructure industries in the Americas, the Asia-Pacific, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. The company offers the Outer Sensor (OS) product line, including OSDome that provides a hemispheric field of view; OS0 for wide view; OS1, for mid-range view; and OS2 for long-range view. It also provides the DF series, a suite of short, mid, and long-range solid-state digital lidar sensors for advanced driver assistance systems (ADAS) and autonomous driving systems; Velodyne that offers surround-view lidar sensors comprising VLP-16, VLP-16 Lite, VLP-16 Hi-Res, VLP-32, and VLS-128; Ouster Gemini, a perception platform designed for smart infrastructure deployments; and BlueCity, a Gemini-powered solution for traffic operations, planning, and safety. In addition, the company offers ZED, a high-performance camera that provides 2D and 3D color data, as well as AI Compute. Further, it is developing solid-state digital flash sensors, a suite of short, mid, and long-range solid-state digital lidar sensors that provide uniform precision imaging without motion blur across an entire field of view. Ouster, Inc. was founded in 2015 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Ouster, Inc.는 미주, 아시아 태평양, 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카의 자동차, 산업, 로봇 공학 및 스마트 인프라 산업을 위한 LiDAR 센서 키트의 생산 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 반구형 시야를 제공하는 OSDome을 포함한 외부 센서(OS) 제품 라인을 제공합니다. 넓은 시야를 위한 OS0; OS1, 중간 범위 보기용; 장거리 보기를 위한 OS2. 또한 고급 운전자 지원 시스템(ADAS) 및 자율 주행 시스템을 위한 단거리, 중거리 및 장거리 솔리드 스테이트 디지털 LiDAR 센서 제품군인 DF 시리즈를 제공합니다. VLP-16, VLP-16 Lite, VLP-16 Hi-Res, VLP-32 및 VLS-128로 구성된 서라운드 뷰 라이더 센서를 제공하는 Velodyne 스마트 인프라 구축을 위해 설계된 인식 플랫폼인 Ouster Gemini 교통 운영, 계획 및 안전을 위한 Gemini 기반 솔루션인 BlueCity. 이 밖에도 2D, 3D 컬러 데이터를 제공하는 고성능 카메라인 ZED와 AI 컴퓨트(AI Compute)도 제공한다. 또한 전체 시야에 걸쳐 모션 블러 없이 균일한 정밀 이미징을 제공하는 단거리, 중거리 및 장거리 고체 디지털 라이더 센서 제품군인 고체 디지털 플래시 센서를 개발하고 있습니다. Ouster, Inc.는 2015년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 샌프란시스코에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":27.9,"mcap":2036620928.0,"pe":null,"fpe":293.6842,"peg":null,"ps":9.063451,"pb":3.62856,"ev_ebitda":-31.665,"div":0.0,"beta":3.489,"hi52":63.79,"lo52":16.4},"fin":{"rev":224707008.0,"rev_g":0.501,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.46342,"op":-0.28176,"net":-0.2036,"roe":-0.11314,"fcf":-79857624.0,"cash":419796000.0,"debt":15363000.0,"de":2.737,"eps":-0.76,"feps":0.095},"own":{"short":0.097200006,"inst":0.54735,"insider":0.023459999},"analyst":{"n":6,"mean":50.83333,"median":51.5,"high":60.0,"low":40.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.0,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":6,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":5,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Amerx","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":52.5,"priorPriceTarget":54.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Rosenblatt","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":53.0,"priorPriceTarget":53.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"up","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":45.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-27","Firm":"Rosenblatt","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":53.0,"priorPriceTarget":53.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-07","Firm":"Rosenblatt","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":53.0,"priorPriceTarget":53.0},{"GradeDate":